  "abstract": "RoboDojo is a unified sim-and-real benchmark for comprehensive evaluation of generalist robot manipulation policies. It contains 42 simulation tasks across five capability dimensions and 18 real-world tasks across three robot embodiments, combines heterogeneous parallel evaluation with RoboDojo-RealEval, and uses XPolicyLab to integrate 30 policies under a shared evaluation interface.",
